#: prefs.js:27
msgid "If you changed maximum charging level to extend battery life"
msgstr ""
"Akoli ty izmenil maksimalny uravenj energije za veče dolgy život batarije"

#: prefs.js:29
msgid "Hide on battery level above"
msgstr "Skryvati kogda uravenj batarije veče"

#: prefs.js:43
msgid "For laptops often jumping between charging and discharging"
msgstr ""
"Za laptopy, ktore često preključajut se medžu dostavjenjem energije i "
"upotrebjenjem energije"

#: prefs.js:45
msgid "Hide battery even on discharge if the level is above"
msgstr "Skryvati pri smenšenju energije, akoli uravenj energije veče"
